<h1>An update on your application</h1>

<p>Hi <%= @applicant.first_name || @applicant.email.split("@").first %>,</p>

<p>Thanks for applying to host on Crewbase. After reviewing your application for <strong><%= @application.property_address %></strong>, we're not able to approve it at this time.</p>

<% if @application.review_notes.present? %>
  <div class="detail-box">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #111c2d;"><%= simple_format(@application.review_notes) %></p>
  </div>
<% end %>

<p>If you think this was a mistake or you'd like to provide more information, just reply to this email.</p>
